  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE ISS REPORT WILL PROVIDE A COMPLEMENTARY PERSPECTIVE ON MACRO TRENDS AND PRIORITISE ACTIONS TO FAVOUR INCLUSIVE, SUSTAINABLE GROWTH.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ISS report will provide the Ministry of Economy and Finance and partners with a complementary perspective on macro trends and prioritise actions to favour the most significant rates of sustainable, inclusive growth. The results will illustrate the interaction between economic/financial sector functions and service sectors, supporting non-economists prioritisation and incentivising teamwork between financial/economic operations and other sectors.</narrative>
  </description>
